{"id":"n67325-4-7","stage":5,"title":"얼어붙다 · 僵住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67325-4-7-1","ko":"분위기가 왜 이래? 완전히 얼어붙어서 아무 말도 못하겠어.","zh":"气氛怎么这样？僵得我一句话都不敢说。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"2","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이래?","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"완전히","meaning":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","explanation":"완전히：完全地，完美地，彻底地","readings":[{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67847","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼어붙어서","meaning":"僵住，冰冷","explanation":"얼어붙다：僵住，冰冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"얼어붙다","audio":"/audio/05affa6c719c84c07cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67325","senseId":"4","lemma":"얼어붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말도","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하겠어.","meaning":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","explanation":"못하다：做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"周围的状况或环境。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"b38cc705c97aaddc","term":"완전히","zh":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3","entryId":"67847","definition":"没有不足之处，具备完整无缺没有瑕疵地。","pronunciation":["완전히"]},{"id":"05affa6c719c84c0","term":"얼어붙다","zh":"僵住，冰冷","audio":"/audio/05affa6c719c84c07cf2.mp3","entryId":"67325","definition":"气氛或内心不温暖而冷。","pronunciation":["어러붇따"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/256954679db3c87e2aed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67325-4-7-2","ko":"요즘 연구 진행 상황이 좋지 않아서 그래.","zh":"最近研究进展不顺利，所以这样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"tex