상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d404e3195271e8e64ee3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.578,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67325","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4047,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近研究进展不顺利，所以这样。","这是直接把小说的内容拍成电影了吗？","气氛怎么这样？僵得我一句话都不敢说。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近研究进展不顺利，所以这样。","气氛怎么这样？僵得我一句话都不敢说。","这是直接把小说的内容拍成电影了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
